          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of a group of straight white lights early in the morning: observation of the Starlink® satellite train from the 2025-008 launch on 01/13/2025.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "7148edade88e6a2bc8e5290ec5a5ce84bc06fb5e0721d0d98f890e1c93e85bd6"
